        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "Master storyteller! Pray forgive my interruption!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_138#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller",
        "text": "Awake from your dream at long last... How long has it been?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "I have seen the plums blossom and wither ten times."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_138#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller",
        "text": "As long as my ink brush remain untouched, the scenery in the painting would never change."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "To tell the truth, I had been counting ever since the moment I entered the painting scroll of Mount Sky. 'Twas indeed that long."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_138#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller",
        "text": "...Ten years?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller",
        "text": "You stayed in the painting for ten years?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "More or less."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_138#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller",
        "text": "You, a mere wandering monk, fiddled away ten full years here. What drove you to partake in such meaningless tribulations?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "Well, I could enjoy a good sleep, partake in all manner of indulgences, and I need not be disturbed by the world, to say nothing of the Catastrophes and infections. I thought it a rather pleasant experience."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_138#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller",
        "text": "Be that as it may, you dreamt... for ten full years."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller",
        "text": "Few are capable of remembering who they truly are after such a long time. Some would forget who they once were and choose to forever remain inside the painting."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "My, how frightening."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_138#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller",
        "text": "Yet you are not afraid at all."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "You are a kind man. I verily believe you would wake them before they cross that point of no return."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_138#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller",
        "text": "Oh? What makes you say that?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "The old fisher at the summit of Mount Sky, the weaver by the banks of the Pu-kuei River, the halberd wielder of the Wu-chieh Plains, the lady innkeeper of the Lungmen Inn... and now the storyteller of the P'o-shan Village... Thou hast reminded me countless of times."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "Yet I chose to deceive myself and continued to indulge in my pleasures, never to wake from my dream. I suppose I must apologize. It must have been tedious to keep me alive in the painting."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_138#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller",
        "text": "Pray be at ease. You came to the mountain when the autumn winds were yet blowing. 'Tis merely the beginning of winter now. It was but a brief dream."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "Hoh! I was worried I would be reprimanded for my sluggish behavior. Little did I know it was but a brief period of time. That certainly puts me at ease."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_138#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller",
        "text": "You already knew of your predicament when you reached Mount Sky, that it was merely a painting. Why waste your time?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "For I saw the truth of Dusk Beauty Flying to the Moon, and I could not well cease thinking about it... A madwoman took matters into her hands and sought to reclaim her true love from the heavens. 'Tis an act of pure lunacy, yet it overwhelms me with a sense of regret..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_138#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller",
        "text": "Hmm... What if I tell you Dusk Beauty's willpower was an addition I made to the painting\u2014that it is of my own making?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "All the nations of this world possess a great many legends, classics, literature, and myths, many of which can be called fabricated. The common folk are not likely to ever experience the machinations written therein. Should we disregard their lessons because they are mere fiction?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "I think 'tis absurd to do so."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_138#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller",
        "text": "You are a strange one."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "There is but a fine line between great and strange. I appreciate your compliment."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_138#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller",
        "text": "...Hah."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller",
        "text": "You are just like your master. He's old, yet he has the heart of a child, a clear mind."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller",
        "text": "You've helped me pass the time... Out of respect for your master, very well, I shall grant you an audience with me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "Um, an audience?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_138#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller",
        "text": "Haha, you cannot possibly believe you've awakened by waltzing in here?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "*gasp*...! Am I yet within the painting?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_138#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller",
        "text": "No need to feel ashamed. This is merely how it's meant to be."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller",
        "text": "If I let you break out merely because you wished so, it would blemish my image."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller",
        "text": "Well, now."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller",
        "text": "Wake up\u2014"
    },
