    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2015_dusk_1#5",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "What's wrong?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "Well... 'Tis merely that I never imagined you... to look like this."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2015_dusk_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "Heh."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "Well, ask away."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "I... I..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "I thought that by surveying the sceneries of these hundred-and-some scrolls, I, too, could walk the journey that thou once walked. Yet... 'Twas but an insignificant fraction of the landscapes thou hast sketched..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2015_dusk_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "Know that there are those who never accept their mistakes and find themselves content with dying here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "That I can understand..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2015_dusk_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "That's not what you wanted to ask."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "Oh, right, I was startled into forgetfulness. My apologies."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "Master, I have once laid my eyes upon the 'Scene of Crude Mounts Utmost Risen' at my head priest's garret. Though at the time I thought there was meaning hidden therein, I could not quite put my finger on it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "I asked the head priest, and he had me leave the monastery to seek out the answer. I have since traveled all over the lands, and though I have since found parts of the answer myself, the ways of the world has me yet confused."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "Since I am blessed with the fortune to meet thee in thy flesh, I thought I would\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2015_dusk_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "If you've had your ideas, why ask me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "I wish merely to learn from thy explanation for my own betterment and to fill in the blanks... To tell the truth, the painting's true meaning eludes me still. Pray tell, wherefore was the end of the waterfall just one swift stroke, leaving naught but a swath of emptiness?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2015_dusk_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "What do you think?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "\u2014Crude mounts utmost risen. The scenery within the scroll extends endlessly. The waterfall soars into the skies, leaving naught but white. 'Tis a way to depict the great mountains and rivers undepictable within the scroll..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2015_dusk_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "Hrm... This is merely conjecture. I am hoping you could do away with the secrecy and reveal the truth. 'Tis making me blush."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2015_dusk_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "Beauty, especially that of an art piece, is in the eye of the beholder. It falls on you to find your own interpretation."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "Nonetheless... You racked your brains so for only that?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "Much of what we do in life is seeking answers."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "If not for this matter gnawing at my mind, I would not have had the fortune to feast my eyes upon thy landscapes within the scrolls."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2015_dusk_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "I suppose so."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "Alas, the stroke you are asking was one that I began at whim and also one that I ended at whim. That's all."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2015_dusk_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "By the time I got to the waterfall, I no longer wanted to continue, and so I stopped there. I took a look afterwards and thought it was rather picturesque, so I gave it a name and sent it your master's way."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "I\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "\u2014I could never have imagined!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2015_dusk_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "Disappointed?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "Having spent such a long time in the painting, and you ended up with quite possibly the most boring answer\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "Not at all. Leaving aside all that I have learned inside the scroll, thy answer is most interesting!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "Drawn on a whim, and stopped on a whim... I once thought that there is meaning to all things upon this world. As time passed, I became far too entrenched in my search, unable to pluck myself out."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "Right, right. We need not be so focused on the meaning behind everything... If there is but one answer, to repeatedly scrutinize would merely be a futile exercise."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "I had heard from my master an aphorism: 'Where there was naught at first, from whence could dust have emerged.' Mayhaps it means the same thing?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2015_dusk_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "...Hah."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "Everyone has their own interpretations. As long as you understand that, it's not necessarily a bad thing to be cocky."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "Oh, I shall keep that in mind. Many thanks."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2015_dusk_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "When I gave your master this piece, I told him merely three words, 'Crude Mounts Utmost.' The 'Risen' in its name... is his interpretation."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "'Risen?'"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2015_dusk_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "Do you know what your master saw in it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_362_Saga#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "He gazed not upon its landscapes with thee?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2015_dusk_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "He didn't."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
