        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 255,
            "g": 255,
            "b": 255,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "image",
        "params": {
            "image": "avg_ac16_3",
            "xscale": 1,
            "yscale": 1,
            "fadetime": 0
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.6
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 255,
            "g": 255,
            "b": 255,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "Is that... my head priest?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "That's right."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "He had scraped the soles of his feet, he was starving, and he walked three full days and nights of hunger."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "He prayed many times, as many as two thousand and a score, and yet he never thought a thing about his life and death. He merely felt sadness and lamented his inability to understand."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "Did you save... my head priest?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "I had already saved him once at the K'u-t'an River. I didn't help him this time."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "Think about it. At his young age, he had already been through such hardships."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "Think about how he went from that to the warm, caring head priest that you know."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "And how he added the word 'risen' to the painting's title."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Saga",
        "text": "Head Priest..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
